    "name":  "Pack TRIAC Dimmer 220V RF Smart  + Remote Control - 2.4GHz",
    "reference":  "PACK-TRI-C1-FUT007",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003ePack TRIAC RF Push Dimmer 220V + RF Remote Control (2.4GHz)\u003c/strong\u003e offers a versatile solution for your lighting needs. The RF remote control \u003cstrong\u003eallows you to turn lights on and off, adjust luminosity, and control brightness.\u003c/strong\u003e Additionally, it provides a control range of up to 30 meters, allowing you to manage your lighting devices from a considerable distance.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003ePack TRIAC Dimmer 220V RF + Remote Control - 2.4GHz\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC RF Push Dimmer 220V Pack + RF Remote Control (2.4GHz)\u003c/strong\u003e for total lighting control. Dims LED luminaires up to \u003cstrong\u003e300W\u003c/strong\u003e. RF remote with 30m range. \u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC Push Dimmer\u003c/strong\u003e via traditional wall button.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy to install on 220V systems. Versatile for installation updates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplications:\u003c/strong\u003e Residential and commercial environments. Living rooms, offices, work areas, large spaces, event halls, shops.\u003c/p\u003e",
